onds "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["ls","nd"],["hs","wd"],["hs","ed"],["at","unless that suit breaks very badly. "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["ls","ed"],["hs","ns"],["hs","ss"],["at","The spade suit is another possible source of a ninth trick."],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["ls","ss"],["hc","s2"],["hs","ns"],["nt","\nTo maximize his chances, South should play the @S2 to dummy "],["pg",""],["lc","s2"],["hs","ns"],["ls","ns"],["pc","s2"],["pc","s"],["pc","sk"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","sa"],["hs","ns"],["at","and play a spade back to the @SA. "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["ls","ns"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","sj"],["at","On the given lie of the cards, South is rewarded. The @SJ drops doubleton "],["pg",""],["lc","sj"],["hc","st"],["at","leaving South in a position to cash the @S10. "],["pg",""],["lc","st"],["pc","st"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","nd"],["at","The dummy can be entered in diamonds "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","da"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hc","sq"],["at","so that the fourth spade winner can be cashed. "],["pg",""],["lc","sq"],["up","16"],["hc","da"],["nt","Notice that if the @DA is played "],["pg",""],["lc","da"],["hs","ns"],["hs","ss"],["at","before the spades are tested, "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["ls","ss"],["hs","es"],["at","South will not be able to take advantage of a doubleton @SJ. "],["pg",""],["ls","es"],["hs","ns"],["hs","ss"],["at","The spade suit will be worth 4 tricks, but the blockage in that suit will make only 3 of those tricks available. "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["ls","ss"],["hs","es"],["at","The contract is still likely to make, but South will have given up on one of his options for trick 9. On the given lie of the cards, the doubleton @SJ is the only option that is working.\n"],["",""]]}}